    "text": "This is a greedy event-driven heuristic. The vehicle that becomes free earliest picks the unassigned ride with the best points-per-step ratio among rides it can still finish on time. A vehicle with no feasible ride is retired, which is safe because rides only get used up and a vehicle's time never goes backwards. Each pop either assigns a ride or retires a vehicle, so the work is about (N+F)\u00b7N \u2248 1e8 simple operations, well within the limit. I have not compiled or run it against the data sets.\n\n```cpp\n#include <bits/stdc++.h>\nusing namespace std;\n\nint main() {\n    ios::sync_with_stdio(false);\n    cin.tie(nullptr);\n\n    long long R, C, F, N, B, T;\n    cin >> R >> C >> F >> N >> B >> T;\n\n    vector<long long> a(N), b(N), x(N), y(N), s(N), f(N), dist(N);\n    for (int i = 0; i < N; ++i) {\n        cin >> a[i] >> b[i] >> x[i] >> y[i] >> s[i] >> f[i];\n        dist[i] = llabs(a[i] - x[i]) + llabs(b[i] - y[i]);\n    }\n\n    vector<vector<int>> plan(F);\n    vector<long long> px(F, 0), py(F, 0), pt(F, 0);\n    vector<char> used(N, 0);\n    vector<char> alive(F, 1);\n\n    // min-heap by (time, vehicle id)\n    priority_queue<pair<long long, int>, vector<pair<long long, int>>, greater<pair<long long, int>>> pq;\n    for (int v = 0; v < F; ++v) pq.push({0LL, v});\n\n    while (!pq.empty()) {\n        auto [t, v] = pq.top();\n        pq.pop();\n        long long cx = px[v], cy = py[v];\n\n        int best = -1;\n        double bestRatio = -1.0;\n        long long bestFinish = 0;\n\n        for (int r = 0; r < N; ++r) {\n            if (used[r]) continue;\n            long long d = llabs(cx - a[r]) + llabs(cy - b[r]);\n            long long arrive = t + d;\n            long long start = max(arrive, s[r]);\n            long long finish = start + dist[r];\n            if (finish > f[r]) continue;\n            long long bonus = (arrive <= s[r]) ? B : 0;\n            double value = (double)(dist[r] + bonus);\n            double denom = (double)(finish - t);\n            double ratio = value / denom;\n            if (best == -1 || ratio > bestRatio ||\n                (ratio == bestRatio && finish < bestFinish)) {\n                best = r;\n                bestRatio = ratio;\n                bestFinish = finish;\n            }\n        }\n\n        if (best == -1) {\n            alive[v] = 0;\n            continue;\n        }\n\n        used[best] = 1;\n        plan[v].push_back(best);\n        px[v] = x[best];\n        py[v] = y[best];\n        pt[v] = bestFinish;\n        pq.push({bestFinish, v});\n    }\n\n    string out;\n    out.reserve(1 << 20);\n    for (int v = 0; v < F; ++v) {\n        out += to_string(plan[v].size());\n        for (int r : plan[v]) {\n            out += ' ';\n            out += to_string(r);\n        }\n        out += '\\n';\n    }\n    cout << out;\n    return 0;\n}\n```",
